      "text": "It’s official!\n\nTraining Center Birmingham-Southern is open for business.\n\nYesterday, we cut the ribbon on the home of our Enlisted Training Center of Excellence. Birmingham-Southern will forge the Coast Guard’s success stories of tomorrow, delivering world‑class instruction and cultivating a highly capable workforce to ensure the Service is fully prepared to meet emerging operational demands. \n\n@DHSgov @SecMullinDHS @SenKatieBritt @SenTuberville @Robert_Aderholt @RepTerriSewell",
